.goose/
.goosehints
plan.md
test.md

# Build artifact: GNOME 45+ compiles the schema at install time. Committing it
# is the most common extensions.gnome.org rejection reason.
*.compiled

# Audit tooling: project-scoped skill definition (local-only, not shipped).
.agents/

# Audit report archive: one dated file per audit plus the cross-audit ledger.
# Already covered by .goose/ above; listed explicitly so the intent survives.
.goose/audits/

# Packaging output: the EGO zip is reproducible via tools/make-package.sh.
dist/
